{
 "lines": [
  [
   "Your Instagram feed loads in under a second...",
   "but the server is thousands of kilometres away.",
   "So how?"
  ],
  [
   "One word.",
   "Caching."
  ],
  [
   "Here's the slow way.",
   "Every time you open the app, it asks the database.",
   "Again. And again.",
   "Every single time."
  ],
  [
   "Now imagine keeping a copy...",
   "right next to you.",
   "First visit? Slow.",
   "Second visit? Instant!"
  ],
  [
   "But wait...",
   "can you spot the problem?"
  ],
  [
   "You change your profile picture.",
   "But your friends...",
   "still see the old one."
  ],
  [
   "That's stale data.",
   "The cache is lying to you."
  ],
  [
   "So smart apps give every copy an expiry timer.",
   "For example, ten minutes.",
   "Then it refreshes."
  ],
  [
   "And when something really changes?",
   "Delete the copy.",
   "Fetch the fresh one."
  ],
  [
   "Fast when it can be.",
   "Fresh when it has to be."
  ],
  [
   "Would you pick speed, or freshness?",
   "Comment below.",
   "And follow for more!"
  ]
 ]
}